<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/static/icon-192.png"><title>Forgot Password</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css"></head><body><div class="box"><h1>🔓 Forgot Password?</h1><p>Enter your email. If it exists in our database, you can set a new password. If not, nothing happens - for your security.</p><form method="POST"><input name="email" placeholder="Your Email" type="email" required><button>Check My Email →</button></form><p><a href="/login">Back To Login</a></p></div><script>
if ("serviceWorker" in navigator) {
  window.addEventListener("load", function() {
